{#
---
name: OISM-TAGS
summary: Enhanced OISM for EVPN/VXLAN ERB driven by tags
config_style: junos
section: top_level_set_delete
roles: [leaf]
category: misc
status: incomplete
requires:
  vars: [os, model, security_zones, vxlan, evpn_interconnect]
  tags: [OISM-PEG-LEAF, OISM-LEAF, OISM-RZ, OISM-VN]
refs:
  - https://www.juniper.net/documentation/us/en/software/junos/evpn/topics/topic-map/evpn-vxlan-dci-enhanced-oism.html
---
Enhanced OISM only with EVPN/VXLAN ERB.

INCOMPLETE - known defects, to be fixed later:
  - OISM_PEG_LEAF_TAG, OISM_VN_TAG, MROUTE_PROTOCOL, IS_IGW_DEVICE and
    IS_OISM_LEAF are set but never used
-#}
{% set OISM_PEG_LEAF_TAG = 'OISM-PEG-LEAF' %}{# Set TAG on OSIM Border (PIM) Leaf devices. Can be iGW, Border Leaf, or server leaf #}
{% set OISM_LEAF_TAG = 'OISM-LEAF' %}
{% set MROUTE_PROTOCOL = 'OSPF' %}{# OR inet.2 #}
{% set OISM_RZ_TAG = 'OISM-RZ' %}{# Add TAG for OSIM Routing Zones. #}
{% set OISM_VN_TAG = 'OISM-VN' %}
{% set PIM_DISTRIBUTED_DR_TAG = 'PIM-DISTRIBUTED-DR' %}
{% set PIM_ACCEPT_REMOTE_SOURCE_TAG = 'PIM-ACCEPT-REMOTE-SOURCE' %}
{% set IS_EVO = 'EVO' in os %}
{% set OISM_RZ_MAP = {
    'FIS': {
        'SBD': 1122,
    }
}
%}
{% set IS_IGW_DEVICE = evpn_interconnect.label %}
{% set OISM_RZ_DICT = security_zones.values() | selectattr('tags', 'defined') | selectattr('tags') | selectattr('tags', 'contains', OISM_RZ_TAG) | list %}
{% if OISM_RZ_DICT%}{# OISM RZ present #}
{% set IS_OISM_LEAF = True %}
set forwarding-options multicast-replication evpn irb enhanced-oism
{% endif %}
{% for RZ_DICT in OISM_RZ_DICT %}{# iterate RZ #}
{% if IS_EVO %}
set routing-instances {{ RZ_DICT.name }} multicast-snooping-options oism conserve-mcast-routes-in-pfe
{% endif %}
{% if 'EX4400' in model %}
set forwarding-options vxlan-dci-enable
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}{# iterate RZ #}
{% for VN in vxlan %}
set routing-instances evpn-1 protocols igmp-snooping vlan {{ VN.name }}
set routing-instances evpn-1 protocols mld-snooping vlan {{ VN.name }}
{% endfor %}
